        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each square is 20 cm. At size M the back panel is 3 squares wide x 5 squares tall (60 x 100 cm). Each front panel is 2 squares wide x 5 squares tall (40 x 100 cm). Each sleeve is 2 squares wide x 3 squares tall (40 x 60 cm). Total squares at size M: 49."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Adjust width by adding one square column per panel for each size step. XS: back 2 wide, fronts 1 wide each. S: back 3 wide, fronts 2 wide each. M: as above. L: back 4 wide, fronts 2 wide each. XL: back 4 wide, fronts 3 wide each. 2XL: back 5 wide, fronts 3 wide each."
          }
        ]
      },
